  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog 0.0.14\n\n## Changes (initial history)\n\n- Support PAL and Dendy debug timing and wrap out-of-range MMC1 PRG banks (`4833819`)\n- Publish the emulator libraries to NuGet (#19) (`75ec51e`)\n- Rename to Zafiro.Nes.Debug (#18) (`27b6624`)\n- fix: set ContentRootPath to AppContext.BaseDirectory to avoid recursive inotify watches (`22bfb0b`)\n- Replace ADNES with AprNes as the sole NES backend (#17) (`68b7e41`)\n- test: certify AprNes NROM conformance (#16) (`2d09c49`)\n- Fix MMC3 frame runs through OAM DMA (#7) (`43f559b`)\n- Add deterministic PPU observability (#5) (`8e09f30`)\n- fix(mcp): resolve DI circular dependency that hung every NES tool call (#4) (`c67ee43`)\n- docs: add emulator license notices (`2d162e5`)\n- feat: complete AprNes debug workflows (`ab902d0`)\n- feat: add AprNes backend for mapper support (`21b956e`)\n- feat: support four-screen nametable VRAM (`24f1a67`)\n- feat: align NES MCP debug workflows with Game Boy (`9283f4c`)\n- feat: align NES MCP debug tools with Game Boy (`460708f`)\n- feat: add NES debug MCP server (`e9ffa71`)\n",
